              <zone fixed-size='1574' forceUpdate='true' h='13352' id='13' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='58379' x='340' y='85990'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>Business Insights:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>1.  </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>TRANSFER transactions have the highest average value (₹910K), making them the largest movement of funds.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>2.  Fraud is concentrated exclusively in TRANSFER and CASH_OUT transactions.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>3. TRANSFER transactions have the highest fraud rate (76.9%), indicating the greatest operational risk.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>4. Prioritizing monitoring of high-value TRANSFER and CASH_OUT transactions can improve fraud detection efficiency.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#b4b4b4' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='10' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone h='13352' id='42' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='40941' x='58719' y='85990'>
