                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>2.  Fraud is concentrated exclusively in TRANSFER and CASH_OUT transactions.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>3. TRANSFER transactions have the highest fraud rate (76.9%), indicating the greatest operational risk.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>4. Prioritizing monitoring of high-value TRANSFER and CASH_OUT transactions can improve fraud detection efficiency.</run>
                </formatted-text>
